<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/portugal/type/Story> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Notícia"@pt .
<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/portugal/type/Story> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A piece this publication wrote, standing on named frozen sources and reviewed by the editor of record before publication."@en .
